      "widgets_values": [
        "A full-body character design concept sheet of a lone adult male antihero, standing in a neutral relaxed pose, front three-quarter view. Tall, lean and wiry rather than muscular. Long dirty black hair, partly tied back, weathered dark long coat with a loose ronin-like silhouette, worn practical clothing, heavy old boots. Serious, calm, imposing presence; he sincerely sees himself as a heroic protector, not a horror villain. No mask and no chainsaw yet. Distinctive original character design, strong readable silhouette, restrained details suitable for consistent hand-drawn animation production. Neutral simple background. High-quality hand-drawn Japanese animated feature-film aesthetic, expressive linework, painted cel-animation feeling, natural anatomy, production character concept art."
